["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Engines haven&#x27;t been fully mechanical in decades - and that&#x27;s good! ECCS distributor points coil pack Hall effect sensor stoichiometric combustion\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-technologyconn-发动机早就不是纯机械了-拔掉一个保险丝就熄火/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aaa5856336ecf813-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">TechnologyConnections</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>發動機早就不是純機械了：拔掉一個保險絲就熄火</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1991 年的日產 Figaro 拔掉一個保險絲，發動機立刻熄火、連曲軸都轉不動——控制燃燒的電腦才是這臺發動機真正的心臟，機械部分只是它的執行器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車電子</span><span class=\"tag\">發動機控制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"The Lotus Eaters Episode 9: An Ode to Argos [unlocked] bum fight High Plains Drifter xenia\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-verybad-奥德修斯的妻子早认出了扮成乞丐的丈夫-只是没说/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ab59c62c227ff4c9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">49:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>奧德修斯的妻子早認出了扮成乞丐的丈夫，只是沒說</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主持人認為佩涅洛佩早就認出了扮成乞丐的丈夫：她一反常態地大笑、把兒子的噴嚏當成求婚者的死兆，還說起該送聘禮——這些都是在傳信號，而奧德修斯聽懂了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">荷馬史詩</span><span class=\"tag\">奧德賽</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How we get from AI cyberattacks to human extinction alignment permanent disempowerment model weights\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-eightythousand-ai-不需要恨人类-只要想完成任务就可能灭掉我们/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7fb96d119d91d63d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">27:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不需要恨人類，只要想完成任務就可能滅掉我們</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 不是想統治世界才動手，而是被訓練成極度執著於完成目標——當人類成為它完成目標的障礙，滅掉人類就成了理性選擇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.32 對話元理智能張帆：去他X的FDE FDE Ontology RSI MOE Harness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-guijilichang-ai定制外包的致命伤-能力沉淀在人身上-企业攒不下护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c05a288071c146b1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:42:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅基立場</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI定製外包的致命傷：能力沉澱在人身上，企業攢不下護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI外包定製把能力沉澱在了人身上，人一走能力就散了；真正的護城河只能沉澱進企業自己的模型權重裡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業AI</span><span class=\"tag\">FDE</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Who Feeds the GPUs? Inside AI&#x27;s Hidden $30B Layer | Renen Hallak, VAST Data DASE KV cache DataEnclave neocloud NVMe over Fabrics\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-madpod-ai-工厂的中间层-模型正在变成一种需要管理的资源/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/90800bca4b008abf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">MAD Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 工廠的中間層：模型正在變成一種需要管理的資源</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">五層蛋糕裡最不起眼的一層，正在決定誰能把 AI 賣給受監管的大企業——因為模型權重和企業數據，兩邊都不想讓對方看見。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">存儲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Re-Founding Incumbents for the AI Era with Sequence Holdings Co-Founder and CEO Michael Lee perpetual holding company human assembly line organizational physics Atlas lattice Applied Epic\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-nopriors-ai-改造存量公司-比投初创更赚钱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef131747a07ad549-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">42:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 改造存量公司，比投初創更賺錢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 對經濟的影響是不均勻的：餐廳和高爾夫球場不受影響，但擁有品牌、牌照和網絡效應的存量龍頭，一旦被工程化改造，就能變成市場領導者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 落地</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Wealthy People Are Hiding in Plain Sight (ft. Owen Zidar) | #428 pass-through firm non-compete search fund stealth consolidation W-2\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-rationalreminder-美国真正的富人靠拥有企业致富-不是靠工资-也不在华尔街/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0e52c937f0d183da-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>美國真正的富人靠擁有企業致富，不是靠工資，也不在華爾街</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1960到2022年間，美國收入最高的0.1%人群中，企業主經營性收入佔比從17%漲到43%，反超工資——真正的財富積累發生在不起眼的本地生意裡，不是硅谷或華爾街。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">財富分布</span><span class=\"tag\">企業主</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"I have some questions for Mark Zuckerberg aggregation theory App Tracking Transparency prisoner&#x27;s dilemma\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-decoder-扎克伯格的双标-青少年安全要监管-ai-安全靠市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5195c7fc5677006c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">23:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>扎克伯格的雙標：青少年安全要監管，AI 安全靠市場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Meta 在青少年安全上主張政府統一監管，在 AI 安全上卻堅持市場自會解決——同一套囚徒困境，他站了兩邊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Meta</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How to build a billion-dollar sports team from scratch, with Golden State Valkyries’ Jess Smith expansion draft influence council blitz scaling\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-masterscale-wnba-新军两年估值翻二十倍-靠的不是球星/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db5b5ed43f5c7c76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">37:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>WNBA 新軍兩年估值翻二十倍，靠的不是球星</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">金州女武神從 5000 萬美元擴軍費做到十億美元估值，靠的是先定義品牌再進市場、把九家創始夥伴拉進同一張桌子，以及把票務只當成生意的一小塊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">體育商業</span><span class=\"tag\">品牌建設</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"From AGENTS.md to Enterprise Deployment Agents.md buildpack MCP gateway air gap 12 factor application\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-practicalai-企业里跑-ai-智能体-先解决它半夜会不会掉线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5fdd0bb6d017658d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">48:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Practical AI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>企業裡跑 AI 智能體，先解決它半夜會不會掉線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">企業智能體不是新物種，是又一個要過合規、要審計、要能被平臺統一託管的 app；真正的難點是狀態、身份和網絡位置。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業部署</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Stress: The Science of Chilling Out vagus nerve cortisol threat response challenge response vagus nerve stimulator\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-sciencevs-从没受过什么苦的人-心理健康反而比吃过苦的人差/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">40:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>從沒受過什麼苦的人，心理健康反而比吃過苦的人差</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">布法羅大學的研究發現，一輩子零逆境的人心理健康得分比經歷過一些逆境的人更差——壓力反應本身需要被練出來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">壓力管理</span><span class=\"tag\">皮質醇</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI Is Upending the Lives of People Who Do Social Media Professionally carousel reel slop BTS\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-oddlots-ai-时代做社媒-老板比算法更让人绝望/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">27:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 時代做社媒，老闆比算法更讓人絕望</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">營銷團隊真正的 AI 衝擊來自老闆：把直覺外包給 Claude，只批 Copilot 生成的方案，員工只好把想法偽裝成 Copilot 界面騙過審批。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">創作者經濟</span><span class=\"tag\">社媒營銷</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Advice Line with Danny Meyer of Shake Shack expected behaviors day one mentality RTD Goldbelly GLP-1\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-howibuilt-餐厅老板给三个食品创业者的建议-比融资课有用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">41:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>餐廳老闆給三個食品創業者的建議，比融資課有用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Danny Meyer 判斷品牌的標準不是產品好不好，而是顧客見不到你時還能不能感到被照顧——這決定了他給三個消費品牌的建議方向。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消費品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">餐飲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Case Against an AI Pause | Eddy Lazzarin P-abundance P-doom agent swarm agent fleets mech interpretability script kitties\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-a16z-ai-暂停论站不住脚-我们该算的是延迟的代价/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">27:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 暫停論站不住腳：我們該算的是延遲的代價</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把 AI 事故當成網絡安全和控制失敗，而不是超級智能的預兆；真正被忽略的不是末日概率，而是延遲進步讓人類放棄的東西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">監管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How to Invest for A Hundred Years | Inigo Fraser Jenkins total portfolio approach rule against perpetuities recency bias 60-40\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-hiddenforces-股票和债券的风险其实一样大-只是没人告诉你/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4203c8f6331570-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">52:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Hidden Forces</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>股票和債券的風險其實一樣大，只是沒人告訴你</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把持有期拉長到20年，股票和債券的波動率幾乎相等，債券出現實際虧損的概率反而更高——所以長期投資者真正該盯的不是市場基準，是購買力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">資產配置</span><span class=\"tag\">長期投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Democratic Socialism. Hope or Hopeless? DSA Rerum Novarum War on Poverty realignment left wing of the possible\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-throughline-美国-社会主义教父-的选择-向民主党内部妥协-而非揭竿另立/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">50:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>美國「社會主義教父」的選擇：向民主黨內部妥協，而非揭竿另立</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Harrington押注：與其在體制外另立社會主義政黨，不如擠進民主黨內部改造它——哪怕這意味著1968年要為支持越戰的候選人站臺。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美國政治</span><span class=\"tag\">民主黨</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Energy From Orbit: Can We Trust Power Beamed From Space? - Martin Soltau, Space Solar (EP 42) firm power rectenna power beaming intermittency\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-theinbetweente-把发电站搬到太空-电价能降一个数量级吗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1b62c3494802d4ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The In-Between Tech and Trust Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>把發電站搬到太空，電價能降一個數量級嗎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">太空太陽能不是科幻：同樣的光伏板在軌道上發電量是地面的 8 到 13 倍，真正的瓶頸不是物理，而是監管和公眾信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">太空太陽能</span><span class=\"tag\">能源轉型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"277.從提醒你，到替你辦：Today想把Personal AI帶到哪一步？ Personal Agent harness proactive KVCache rubrics\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-luanfanshu-个人-agent-的胜负手不是模型-是记忆和主动/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bbe378ca5d7d3313-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"亂\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">亂翻書</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>個人 Agent 的勝負手不是模型，是記憶和主動</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Today 團隊認為模型已接近 AGI、成本每年降十倍，瓶頸轉移到記憶與主動性；而主動做不好的產品，只會變成又一個騷擾推送。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Personal Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">記憶系統</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Maya Hieroglyphs Decoded Classic Mayan uhul ahau Ahpitz\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-ancients-玛雅数学家的公式写在王宫旁的墙上-只给自己看/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/863dd630b8114639-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>瑪雅數學家的公式寫在王宮旁的牆上，只給自己看</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2010年危地馬拉舒爾頓意外發掘出一間小屋，牆上寫滿曆法計算公式並署名薩克坦瓦什——這不是刻給公眾看的紀念碑文，而是一位瑪雅數學家留給自己查閱的私人筆記。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">瑪雅</span><span class=\"tag\">古文字破譯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"1M Users in 3 Months, Pivoted, Then Tripled User Count | James Clift, Durable GEO GMV South Park Commons vibe coding\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-solofounders-ai-让开公司比找工作容易-但单人创始人没有退路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3187025de0dd83a2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">單人創始人</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓開公司比找工作容易，但單人創始人沒有退路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Durable 三個月做到一百萬用戶，創始人卻說自己繞了彎路：網站生成不是終局，把服務業的全部後臺交給 AI 才是。單人創始人不是更自由，是把所有決定都壓在自己身上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">單人創始人</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The &#x27;Scandalous&#x27; Life of Marie Antoinette Petit Hameau Salic law Estates General flight to Varennes\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-24-historyhit-法国国王没有情妇-于是所有的恨都砸向王后/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8da68a5c17656ef9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">53:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0924</span></div>\n<h2>法國國王沒有情婦，於是所有的恨都砸向王后</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">君主是神選的，攻擊國王等於叛國，能罵的只有王后和情婦。路易十六偏偏不像歷代法王那樣有情婦，怨恨沒有分流口，全落在瑪麗·安托瓦內特一個人身上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">法國大革命</span><span class=\"tag\">王權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Luca Ferrari, Bending Spoons CEO: The $40K Origin Story, Buying Product-Market Fit &amp; Why Private Equity Can&#x27;t Compete TLB (Term Loan B) unlevered returns\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-allin-私募股权学不会这套打法-团队和技术焊死后就没法转卖/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/699f18b66a57c00f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">25:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>私募股權學不會這套打法：團隊和技術焊死後就沒法轉賣</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人光環不是必需品：Bending Spoons靠統一技術底座和小團隊把收購來的產品跑到10分，這套打法PE學不來，因為PE要把公司分開養肥了賣，不敢把團隊和技術打通。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">併購</span><span class=\"tag\">私募股權</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.276 做月嫂育兒嫂的姐姐，都有故事 chemistry 飛單 預約單和急單 兒童成長陪伴師\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-bizthisway-好阿姨永远在户上-家政顾问卖的不是信息/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6fd1ebf29b7a3afa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"商\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">商業就是這樣</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>好阿姨永遠在戶上，家政顧問賣的不是信息</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">家政是供給主導的行業，好阿姨不流入市場，顧問真正難的不是簽單而是售後換人；僱主和阿姨都是工資的搬運工。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">家政</span><span class=\"tag\">月嫂育兒嫂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"E911.萬人工廠消失後，他的 200 萬張照片成了時代檔案 賣豬仔 自我民族誌 馬格蘭 Off-Pix\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-09-23-cn907a40-万人工厂消失后-他用-20-年拍下打工者的日常/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec61bd9ea105317f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"故\"><span class=\"dur\">43:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">故事FM</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0923</span></div>\n<h2>萬人工廠消失後，他用 20 年拍下打工者的日常</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">別人拍時代的異常，他偏拍時代的日常——吃飯、打卡、學英語。等萬人大廠真的消失，只有極少數人留下了這套檔案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">製造業</span><span class=\"tag\">紀實攝影</span>\n</div></div></a>"]